<?xml version="1.0"?>
<model>
  <name>sensor_rgbd_front</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version='1.9'>model.sdf</sdf>
  <description>
    S10 MEASUREMENT MODEL, 2026-08-26. Not flown, not bridged, not launched.

    Collapses sensor_camera_front and sensor_depth_front into a single
    rgbd_camera so the question "does one fewer render pass move RTF on
    uav0_full?" can be answered with a number instead of an argument.

    NOT a drop-in replacement: the pair it replaces carries two DIFFERENT clip
    ranges on purpose (RGB 0.1-100 m, depth 0.2-19.1 m). One sensor has one
    clip, so merging costs the RGB stream everything past 19.1 m. Shipping it
    would need the marker and obstacle gates re-run, not just an RTF number.
  </description>
</model>
